# Myra's voice model.
#
# Qwen2.5 3B Instruct (Q4_K_M) on top of Ollama's official image. Replaced the
# earlier 0.6B model: at the same GPU latency (~270ms to first spoken word) it
# answers grounded lookups correctly where the 0.6B hallucinated (e.g. it reads
# the right god of Death, Crael, straight out of the injected roster). Not a
# reasoning model, so there is no chain-of-thought to disable.
#
# num_ctx is pinned small on purpose: the compact system prompt is ~1,800 tokens,
# so 8k leaves comfortable room for several conversation turns while keeping
# prefill fast and KV-cache VRAM tiny (~0.3 GB) on the 8 GB card.
#
# Rebuild after editing:
#   ollama create suwanee-schedule -f Modelfile
FROM qwen2.5:3b

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
